item.description:
You&rsquo;re probably seeing a lot of personal AI assistants on the market right now. I keep getting ads while I&rsquo;m watching YouTube — Meta&rsquo;s Muse is one of them. &ldquo;What can I take off your plate?&rdquo; the ad asks. &ldquo;Your Muse gets it done.&rdquo;
For the people using something like Muse and saying it&rsquo;s great, I want to ask you a question.
Have you thought about why it&rsquo;s so good?
